 0 85.5 0 112v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V306.2c0-10.7-12.9-16-20.5-8.5l-40 40c-2.2 2.3-3.5 5.3-3.5 8.5z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-edit icons\"></i> --> Edit Insert</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg addbut\" href=\"workflow/144394\"><svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-list-alt fa-w-16 icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fa-processed=\"\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"list-alt\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M464 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h416c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zM128 120c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm288-136v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-list-alt icons\"></i> --> Insert Workflow</a><br><br><div class=\"whitebar\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><h2>UPDATE: Bulungula</h2></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><strong>By: <a href=\"user-view/101\">Laura Byrne</a> | Commission</strong></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><div class=\"col-sm-9 inspadd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Proposal</h3><br><span class=\"headin\">Show:</span> Carte Blanche<br><br><span class=\"headin\">One Liner (Tonight on Carte Blanche...):</span><br>A year and a half after we reported on a crime wave engulfing a picturesque Eastern Cape village, residents lay positive news at our door.<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Summary: </span><br>In September 2024 we visited Dave Martin and his wife Rejane Woodroffe at their tourist lodge on the Wild Coast, Bulungula. For twenty years they had built a life and a community there... but in recent months, violent crime overshadowed their lives and threatened the tourist economy they all depended on. Homeowners were left seriously injured and one killed by armed robbers; the whole community was shaken and fearful. The mayor promised arrests and a new police station.<br>\n<br>\nBut in March 2025, we returned to more bad news. Crime had continued unabated. Despite promises of increased police visibility in the area, there had been no assistance for communities living in fear. One couple had been violently attacked again, shot and beaten. Tourism had taken a massive knock.<br>\n<br>\nNow, Dave has been in touch to share a positive development at last. One suspect has been arrested with guns and goods that were stolen from victims. He is currently in jail and awaiting a bail hearing on 25 February. One well-known criminal and major suspect died in a SAPS shootout two weeks ago. And best of all, the last attack in the region was more than one year ago. We catch up with Dave to hear how he and the community are recovering.<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Case Study:</span><br><a href=\"case-study/118376\">Dave Martin</a><br><a href=\"case-study/118377\">Rejane Woodroffe</a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Extra Footage:</span><br>Carte Blanche Archive<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Other Footage Sources:</span><br>Carte Blanche archive<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> Yes<br><span class=\"headin\">Reason for legal:</span> Possible municipality ROR.<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\