  "text": "Add New Proposal Shows Add New Show View All Shows 17 May 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 10 May 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 03 May 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 26 April 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 19 April 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 12 April 2026 - Carte Blanche HD 05 April 2026 - Carte Blanche HD Hi Lezanne [My Account] [Logout] Home Viewer Submissions Reports Contacts Music Cue Sheet Manage Users View Insert Edit Insert Insert Workflow UPDATE: Bulungula By: Laura Byrne | Commission Proposal Show: Carte Blanche One Liner (Tonight on Carte Blanche...): A year and a half after we reported on a crime wave engulfing a picturesque Eastern Cape village, residents lay positive news at our door. Summary: In September 2024 we visited Dave Martin and his wife Rejane Woodroffe at their tourist lodge on the Wild Coast, Bulungula. For twenty years they had built a life and a community there... but in recent months, violent crime overshadowed their lives and threatened the tourist economy they all depended on. Homeowners were left seriously injured and one killed by armed robbers; the whole community was shaken and fearful. The mayor promised arrests and a new police station. But in March 2025, we returned to more bad news. Crime had continued unabated. Despite promises of increased police visibility in the area, there had been no assistance for communities living in fear. One couple had been violently attacked again, shot and beaten. Tourism had taken a massive knock. Now, Dave has been in touch to share a positive development at last. One suspect has been arrested with guns and goods that were stolen from victims. He is currently in jail and awaiting a bail hearing on 25 February. One well-known criminal and major suspect died in a SAPS shootout two weeks ago. And best of all, the last attack in the region was more than one year ago. We catch up with Dave to hear how he and the community are recovering. Case Study: Dave Martin Rejane Woodroffe Extra Footage: Carte Blanche Archive Other Footage Sources: Carte Blanche archive Hidden Camera: No Legal: Yes Reason for legal: Possible municipality ROR. Graphics: No Accept / Reject Status: Approved Proposal Date: Tuesday, 03 March 2026 Approved By: Stenette Grosskopf Approval Date: 03 March 2026 Commission Commission Number: 6871 Duration: 4 Delivery Date: Sunday, 08 March 2026 Accept Contract: I agree with the following CAP Contractual Agreement Legal Viewing: Yes Accepted By: Stenette Grosskopf Accepted Date: 03 March 2026 Broadcast / Delivery Broadcast: MOD Approved for Broadcast by Editor: No Approved for Payment: No Insert Details Presenter: Macfarlane Moleli Booked Footage Footage returned: No Footage Declaration I confirm that all footage agreements have been signed and submitted via Jotform: No Music Cue Sheet Music Title Type Track Number Duration Publisher CMO Composer Record/CD Number Phahla No VOX Production 38 00:00:44 Fat Mama Publishing SAMRO Luyolo Lenga and Gideon Murray MDML258 Disturbed Production 4 00:00:28 The Music Supervisors Philip Anderson TSM013 Forsaken Lands Production 00:00:26 Fat Mama Publishing SAMRO Ryan Grogan MDML219 Transkei Bliss Minimal Production 24 00:00:25 Fat Mama Publishing SAMRO Gideon Murray MDML142 Nearby Danger Production 7 00:00:17 The Music Supervisors Philip Anderson TMS013 Transkei Morning Production 13 00:00:19 Mathamba Music Publishing Jerry Barnard and Ryan Grogan and Jaco Maria AFR015 Time and Space Production 9 00:00:11 Fat Mama Publishing SAMRO Ryan Grogan MDML309 Time and Space Production 9 00:00:20 Fat Mama Publishing SAMRO Ryan Grogan MDML309 TX Details Back references from Insert in Show: Title Author Last Updated 08 March 2026 - Carte Blanche HD mihle@combinedartists.co.za 15 March 2026 TX Date: 0000-00-00",
